    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retr0Mine brings the classic Minesweeper into modern age with extensive customization and quality-of-life features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coop mode: Play with a friend realtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No guess: Grids are fully solvable with deduction</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple sound themes to match your mood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nice animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible gameplay mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-reveal of connected safe cells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Question marks toggle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invertible mouse buttons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-click protection</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comprehensive save/load system preserving your game state</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive hint system to help when stuck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five difficulty settings (including custom grids)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every feature can be enabled or disabled according to your preferences, letting you create your perfect Minesweeper experience. Whether you prefer a pure classic approach or enjoy modern conveniences, Retr0Mine adapts to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retr0Mine will continue to grow with new features and improvements through free updates - no additional purchases, ever.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retr0Mine brings the classic Minesweeper into modern age with extensive customization and quality-of-life features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coop mode: Play with a friend realtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No guess: Grids are fully solvable with deduction</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple sound themes to match your mood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nice animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible gameplay mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-reveal of connected safe cells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Question marks toggle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invertible mouse buttons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-click protection</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comprehensive save/load system preserving your game state</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive hint system to help when stuck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five difficulty settings (including custom grids)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every feature can be enabled or disabled according to your preferences, letting you create your perfect Minesweeper experience. Whether you prefer a pure classic approach or enjoy modern conveniences, Retr0Mine adapts to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retr0Mine will continue to grow with new features and improvements through free updates - no additional purchases, ever.</p>",
    "short_description": "A modern take on Minesweeper with quality-of-life features. Save your progress, use hints, and customize gameplay settings to your liking. Whether you're a veteran or newcomer, enjoy a polished experience that honors the classic.",
